MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Beach Boys fit the melodic '60s pop I seek in the Beatles and AM Gold, making that collection an especially appealing next choice.",
    "Gordon Lightfoot and Bread fit the folk songwriting and mellow songs that draw me to Jonathan Edwards and Simon & Garfunkel; Eagles also fit my interest in familiar classic rock."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Kansas fits the broad classic rock theme, but I want gentler pop and folk songs right now, so that connection alone is not enough.",
    "I cannot judge whether The Very Best Of suits my listening without knowing the artist, and I would want to check the songs on Chronicle before choosing it."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in classic rock seems to have been taken as interest in any classic rock collection, although mood and songwriting matter more to today's choices.",
    "My frequent listening to greatest-hits collections seems to have been treated as a reason to offer more compilations, even though I would only choose a few at once."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The strongest connection for me is melodic pop and gentle folk songwriting, rather than simply music from the same decades.",
    "Something can fit my taste without being a choice for today: Gary Puckett and Chicago appeal to me, but less strongly than the Beach Boys and Gordon Lightfoot on this visit."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations understood my interest in familiar older songs and collections, but sometimes gave that broad connection more weight than my current preference for melodic pop and gentle folk."
}
